  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<b><size=+10>Tips and Strategies</size></b>

    <b>\u2022 Clear Long
    Sequences First:</b> Always look for the longest potential sequence of moves
    across the Tableau before drawing from the Stock to clear as many cards as possible.

    <b>\u2022
    Prioritise Bigger Columns:</b> Focus on removing cards from columns with more
    cards in them, the more cards in a column the harder it is to get through them
    all.

    <b>\u2022 The Stock Is Your Countdown:</b> Treat the Stock as a countdown
    to game over. There are only 17 cards in the Stock and, if you run out, then
    you have no more chances.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -6622473957194473056, guid: 7953b3aff3010de47827554b597de01f, type: 2}
